        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo kigambo ekyabaasirwe aha irungu ly'omwaro gw'enyanja. Nk'okwo akazimu kema omuli Negebu kakagenda nikeya eirungu, nikwo ekibundo kiraruga omu nsi elikutinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kubonekerwa kwange mboinemu ebiyengo ebibi muno: Omunyagi nanyaga, asilikya nasilikya. Oyeyambe iwe ihe lya Elamu; iwe ihe lya Media obunde ebigo. Enaku zona ezitura zitabuka ahali Babiloni nazimara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo ninchundwa engingo zona, ninshasha muno nk'omukazi alikurumwa; nafa nayosha, n'agabona tinkiinago, enaku zankiza amani n'okuhulira tinkihulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagezi tinkiinago, n'obutini nakwatwa obushaguliraine. Ntuura ndindiliire akalembabazana, kyonkai mbwenu enaku zishai nizo nabona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabona abantu nibatekateka obugenyi, nibara emikeka, nibalya, nibanywa. Aho honkai mpulira eiraka liti, Mwimuke inywe bakuru, musiige engabo zanyu amajuta! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama angambiire ati, “Ogende oteho omulinzi agambe ebyo arata nabona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'arabona ab'efarasi babili babili, n'abakuubire endogobe n'engamia, ohulilizege, ohulilize n'obwegendeleza bungi muno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma omulinzi agya agira abo yabona, agamba n'eiraka lihango ati, “Waitu Mukama, omushana gwona ninsiiba nyemeleire aha munara obutasimbukaho, n'omu kiro kwakwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu nimbona abakuubire efarasi babili babili!” Omukama ahorora omulinzi ati, “Babiloni tekiliho, tekiliho, n'ebihuuku bya baruhanga bamwo byona bikuntukire ahansi byayatayatika.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe Baisiraeli batahi bange, babashekwire baberura nk'engano, nawe mbwenu nabatona amakuru garungi ago Omukama Rushoborabyona, Ruhanga wa Isiraeli angambiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo ekyabaasirwe ahali Duma. Omulinzi ati, Haliho alikunyeta ayemire Seiri ati, “Iwe mulinzi, obwire bwabaki, nka butakya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omulinzi agira ati, “Obwire bukya, kyonkai eizoba lishuba litobera. K'oraba nogonza kushuba kumbaza oragaruka ombaze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo kigambo ekyabaasirwe ahali Arabia: Inywe bijuru by'Abadedani, murata nimurara omw'ishwa lya Arabia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe aba Tema abaina eiliho, mubajune mubatwalire amashugi, atulikusingwa mubahe akakulya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu nibairuka kuhunga aha mbanda eziraliire kubaita, nibasingwa emyambi etabarasha, n'enaku zona z'endashana zitabagwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba inye Omukama angambiire ati, “Omwaka guhoileho, omwaka nk'ogw'omupakasi, Kedari erahwaho yona n'ekitinwa kyayo eyebeke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'emanzi za Kedari ezirasha emyambi zirakira zike, aha rw'okuba eki kigambirwe Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
